.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE RELEASE REMOVE"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone release remove \- Remove a release version from the milestone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone release remove [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a release version from the milestone
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --confirm-remove
Confirm removing the release and its milestone progress
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the release was removed
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
